        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What makes the 7‑layer protective packaging system superior for my household goods?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The system combines eight‑mil bubble wrap, high‑density foam edge protectors, multi‑ply corrugated sheets, weather‑proof stretch film, and custom wooden crates where needed. Each layer is designed to absorb shocks, prevent moisture ingress, and distribute weight evenly. Packers Movers Jharkhand/Bokaro/Chas Bazar tailors the configuration to the specific fragility of items, ensuring maximum safety.</p>
